# Droplets for WebCLAP

Droplets by aquanode, a stochastic water bubble synthesizer after xoxos' Water, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an
official aquanode release.

- Droplets: https://github.com/aquanodemusic/aquanode-plugins/tree/main/synths/droplets (commit 35f0676, version 1.1)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-droplets.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/droplets-headless.patch`): the processor builds without its editor for the DSP
module. The editor's Arial labels are drawn in DejaVu Sans.

